<BRK/>
]<OLI>Communications with building automation system using Modbus RTU protocol via RS-485 cable connection.</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
]</SPT>[<SPT><TTL><SUB>RESIDENTIAL LOAD CENTERS</SUB></TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  Use the following paragraph and subparagraphs in lieu of the paragraph PANELBOARD and its subparagraphs 
if designer has chosen to specify residential load centers in the design.  Load centers are permitted only for 
