<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  NFPA 70 requires that all branch circuits that supply 120 volt, single phase, 15 and 20 ampere outlets 
installed in dwelling unit family rooms, dining rooms, living rooms, parlors, libraries, dens, bedrooms, sunrooms, 
