<BRK/>
<TXT><RID>UL 489</RID>, <RID>UL 1699</RID> and <RID>NFPA 70</RID>.  Molded case circuit breakers:  rated as indicated.[  Two pole arc-fault circuit-interrupters:  rated 120/240 volts.  
The provision of (two) one pole circuit breakers for shared neutral circuits in lieu of (one) two pole circuit breaker is unacceptable.]  Provide 
