<OLI>Current transformer secondary leads:  not smaller than<MET> 6 mm^2</MET><ENG> No. 10 AWG</ENG>.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Control wire minimum size: <MET> 2.5 mm^2</MET><ENG> No. 14 AWG</ENG>.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Power wiring for 480-volt circuits and below:  the same type as control wiring with<MET> 4 mm^2</MET><ENG> No. 12 AWG</ENG> minimum size.</OLI><BRK/>
