<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Motor short-circuit protectors, also called motor circuit protectors (MCPs):  <RID>UL 508</RID> and <RID>UL 489</RID>, and provided as shown.  Provide MSCPs that consist 
